---
import { ATTRACTION, googleReviewAttribution } from '../data/attraction';

interface Props {
  /** 图片授权来源行（保持与 docs/IMAGE_SOURCES.md 一致） */
  photoCredits?: Array<{ file: string; author: string; license: string; source: string }>;
}
const {
  photoCredits = [
    {
      file: 'Pykara landscape (author title: Scenic View of Pykara Lake and Surroundings)' ,
      author: 'Prasannakamble25',
      license: 'CC BY-SA 4.0',
      source: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scenic_View_of_Pykara_Lake_and_Surroundings.jpg'
    },
    {
      file: 'படகு சவாரி / Boating',
      author: 'KARTY JazZ',
      license: 'CC BY-SA 4.0',
      source: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boating_in_Pykara_Lake_in_Ooty,_Tamil_Nadu.JPG'
    },
    {
      file: 'நீர்வீழ்ச்சி / Falls',
      author: 'Prasannakamble25',
      license: 'CC BY-SA 4.0',
      source: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pykara_Falls_in_the_Nilgiris,_Tamil_Nadu_-_Front_View.jpg'
    }
  ]
} = Astro.props;
---
<section id="sources" class="section bg-[#edf2ed]"><div class="container-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Sources &amp; photo credits</p><h2 class="section-title mt-3">மூலங்கள் · Sources and their limits</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-5">2026-10-29 அன்று சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது. பழைய சுற்றுலாப் பக்கம் நடப்பு நேரம், விலை அல்லது திறந்த நிலையை உறுதி செய்யாது. புகைப்படங்கள் எடுத்த தேதியின் காட்சிகள்; இன்றைய செயல்பாட்டை உறுதி செய்யாது.</p><div class="card mt-8 p-7">
<div class="source-row"><h3 class="font-bold">Nilgiris District Administration — Pykara</h3><p class="prose-copy text-sm" lang="en">The district page describes the lake, river, falls and broad location. Its stated update is 16 July 2018: background, not a current fare, timetable or facilities audit.</p><a class="underline" href="https://nilgiris.nic.in/tourist-place/pykara-ooty/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">District primary source ↗</a></div>
<div class="source-row"><h3 class="font-bold">TTDC — current booking checks</h3><p class="prose-copy text-sm" lang="en">The official TTDC app lists Pykara among its boat-house booking locations and offers date/boat-type selection. Use the official portal to check your selected product and final price. No current Pykara tariff or universal daily timetable was established for this guide.</p><p><a class="underline" href={ATTRACTION.operatorUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official TTDC portal ↗</a> · <a class="underline" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ttdcbooking.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official app listing ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="source-row"><h3 class="font-bold">Google Maps — dated observation</h3><p class="prose-copy text-sm">{googleReviewAttribution.blockTa}</p><p class="prose-copy text-sm" lang="en">{googleReviewAttribution.blockEn} The supplied check showed closing at 17:30 and reportedly no accessible entrance; third-party observations, not an operator timetable or on-site access audit. Broad address: Pykara, Naduvattam, Tamil Nadu. Confirm the gate instead of relying on an unresolved Plus Code.</p><a class="underline" href={ATTRACTION.mapsListingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Maps ↗</a></div>
<div class="source-row"><h3 class="font-bold">Photographs / புகைப்படங்கள்</h3><ul class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-7">{photoCredits.map(p=><li><strong>{p.file}</strong> — {p.author} · <a class="underline" href={p.license.includes('SA')?'https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/':'https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/'} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{p.license}</a> · <a class="underline" href={p.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original Commons file ↗</a></li>)}</ul><p class="prose-copy mt-4 text-sm" lang="en">View from the boat: 2016; Pykara landscape and falls photographs: 2025. Local copies are auto-oriented, resized and JPEG-compressed; page frames may crop them. The hero shows the historical view from the lake toward shore; the social image is cropped from that same 2016 photograph. All these adaptations remain under CC BY-SA 4.0. Photographs do not establish current facilities or operation. No endorsement is implied.</p><p class="mt-3"><a class="underline" href="/IMAGE-SOURCES.txt">Per-file source, license and modification record</a></p></div>
</div><p class="prose-copy mt-6" lang="en">Independent nonprofit tourism and educational guide; not TTDC, Google or a government website. It does not collect Maps reviews, sell tickets or guarantee access.</p></div></section>
